**(H2) LOCAL NO-CORNER ("a minimising broken geodesic is straight").**
Needed at each recursion step: if `p_{k-1}, p_k, p_{k+1}` are such that
`d(p_{k-1},p_k) = d(p_k,p_{k+1}) = ε` and `d(p_{k-1},p_{k+1}) = 2ε`, and both segments are
