**(H3) THE RECURSION ITSELF** (once (H1) and (H2) are available): with a uniform `ε > 0` and, for
`L := d(p,q)`, the sequence `p_{k+1} :=` the minimiser of `d(·,q)` on `{z : d(p_k,z) = ε}`, one has
