  `(Yp Φ, Zp Φ + Γ̂Yp)` solves the vector Jacobi system with initial data `(0,x)`, so by
  uniqueness of the linear ODE (`Commons.Analysis.ODE.eqOn_of_hasDerivAt_linearODE`, with the bound
  above) it equals the column `D.Y · x` of any Jacobi tensor of the family's chart geodesic.
