   * work with the project's global objects `geodCurve`/`GExp` (`Submission/GlobalExp.lean`,
     `Submission/HopfRinow2.lean`) rather than with an abstract geodesic: let
     `Gp := geodCurve (cov := cov) hmet T hT q ξ hξ` (unit speed, `‖ξ‖ = 1`, `T ≥ L`) and put
