     `Minimising.riemannianEDist_eq_ofReal_of_unit_speed_of_minimising` gives the *sub-arcs*
     `d(Gp a, Gp b) = ofReal (b - a)` (so `d(q, Gp (L-δ)) = ofReal (L-δ)`);
