### 31.2 `Submission/HingeGlobal.lean` (ns `Submission.HingeGlobal`) — the hinge-comparison language

* `modelDist1 θ a b = arccos (cos a cos b + sin a sin b cos θ)` (the model distance of curvature 1);
* `hingeAngle v w = arccos ⟪v,w⟫`, `cos_hingeAngle` (`= ⟪v,w⟫` for unit `v`, `w`);
* `HingeCompAt cov z v w a b` — the hinge comparison at the apex `z`;
* `CompHolds cov z r` — *the predicate of the Key Lemma*: the comparison holds at `z` for all hinges
