### 34.2 THE FIRST INGREDIENT: WHERE EXACTLY IT COMES FROM

In route (M) the role of `λ` is the conversion
`‖v‖_E ≤ (1/√λ)·‖v‖_{fibre at z}` (`chartGram_self_eq_norm_sq` + `exists_chartGram_bounds` at the
