* **orthogonal (Rauch)**: `⟪(Y 1) y, (Y 1) y⟫_p ≤ (sin r/r)² ⟪y,y⟫_q` for `y ⊥ u` — this is
  `exists_uniform_chartFlow_rauch_bound_of_data` transported along `clm` (or
  `RauchChart.rauch_bound_arbitrary_base`);
* **identification of the differential**: `(mfderiv (chartFlowExp D q) u) y = frameVector z₀ p ((Y 1) y)`
  (`ChartGeoAt.mfderiv_of_eq_chartFlow`); hence `D y = clm_p ((mfderiv ...) y)`.

### 39.3 THE REMAINING WORK (exact recipe)

