    `S.attach.image ρa` (`Finset.min'_le s H h` takes the membership *last*).
11. `MeasureTheory.setLIntegral_const` needs its two explicit arguments
    (`setLIntegral_const _ _`); `ENNReal.ofReal 1 * x = x` needs `rw [ENNReal.ofReal_one, one_mul]`.
12. `Conv` is the tool for rewriting one side of an equation only:
    `conv_lhs => rw [← frameVector_clm ...]` (a plain `rw` would also rewrite the argument of
