`Submission/Klingenberg.lean`:

```lean
def KlingenbergBound [I.Boundaryless] [CompactSpace M] [SimplyConnectedSpace M]
    (cov : ...) : Prop :=
  ∀ (g : RiemannianMetric ...), (smooth) → IsMetricCompatibleFor g cov →
    (∀ p u v, orthonormal → 1 ≤ sec(g)) → (∀ p u v, orthonormal → sec(g) < 4) →
    ∃ p q : M, ENNReal.ofReal (Real.pi / 2) < Manifold.riemannianEDist I p q
```

i.e. **`sec ∈ [1,4)` ⟹ there is a diameter pair at distance `> π/2`** — the diameter form of (K2)
