   along every minimal geodesic ⟹ conjugate along some minimal geodesic";
2. **the geodesic-loop branch**: every geodesic loop at `p` (equivalently, by Xu, every closed
   geodesic) has length `> π` when `sec ∈ [1,4)`.  Equivalently (rescaling):
   **every closed geodesic has length `≥ 2π/√(sup sec)` when `sec ≥ 1`**.  This is the classical
