  its uses, hence **no transport along the point equality is ever needed**).
* `midPt`, `halfFun`, `halfVel`, `midPt_eq`, `halfVel_eq`, `halfVel_eq_half_deriv`,
  **`halfVel_eq_clm`**, **`deriv_ray_eq_clm_of_split`**, `half_smul_inv_smul` — the second half of
