### 82.3 THE STEP IS DONE — `GExp` is `C^∞` at *every* vector (this session)

Contrary to the plan of §82.2, the whole doubling chain is now **complete and sorry-free**
(`Submission/GExpSmooth.lean`, imported by `Submission.lean`, `#print axioms` =
`propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound`):

* `contMDiffAt_halfFun` — the chart coordinate of the ray is `C^∞` (from the induction hypothesis at
