* **`contMDiffAt_gexpChart_of_half`** — the core step: `C^∞` at `(q₀,u₀)` from `C^∞` at the half
  vector and at the midpoint state `(midPt, halfVel)`.  Its proof is the assembly described below;
* **`smoothOnBall_step`** — `SmoothOnBall R → SmoothOnBall (2*R)`, i.e. the doubling;
* **`contMDiffAt_gexpChart_all`** — `2^k·δ` gives every radius;
* **`contMDiffAt_GExp`** and **`exists_contMDiffAt_GExp`** — **the exponential map is `C^∞` at every
  tangent vector** (the "no hypotheses" form, taking the finite atlas from
  `Commons.Geometry.Manifold.exists_finite_cover_isCompact_subset_chartAt` and the base radius from
