`propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound`):

* **`exists_jacobiSystem_init`** — existence of a solution of the Jacobi system with **arbitrary**
  initial data `(A, B)` at an **arbitrary** base time `t₀ ∈ Icc a b` (the existing
