* **`eqOn_fundamental_of_jacobiSystem`** — **the two-fundamental-solutions spanning statement**: for
  the coefficient `jacobiSysVec x₀ (gc Φ) (gv Φ)` on `Icc a b`, if `(Y,U)` is the solution with data
