* `Function.comp` is not beta-reduced by `simpa`: after
  `(ContMDiffOn f univ).comp (ContMDiffOn g s) _` the composite is `f ∘ g`, and `simpa` will *not*
  turn it into the lambda `fun x => f (g x)`.  Fix: `rw [show f ∘ g = (fun x => f (g x)) from rfl] at h`.
* **`Manifold.riemannianEDist_triangle` needs its `x y z` given explicitly** when the surrounding
  term is not yet determined: with implicit arguments the instance search demands
  `∀ x, ENormSMulClass ℝ (TangentSpace I x)` (a Pi-type instance that does not exist) and fails.
