   new, sharper target than the general "fold" of §80.4: the local-diffeomorphism property is needed
   only on `D̃_p`, i.e. `‖v‖ < τ`, and the missing classical input is the inequality `σ ≤ κ`.*
2. **The range condition**: the points `γ(t)`, `t < d(q,x₀)`, lie in `GExp p '' D̃_p` — i.e. `γ(t)` is
