2. the **cut-off field** `W u := χ(u) • Z u` with `χ(u) = -u(u-L)/(t(t-L))` satisfies `W 0 = W L = 0`
   and `W t = -∇J(t)` (needs `SmoothAlongAt γ W s` for all `s`, via
