* `ParallelGlobal.kOf_last` (`kOf C hN (C.c C.N) = C.N - 1`) is the lemma that pins the piece of
  `transport`; `C.N - 1` needs `0 < C.N` (`C.c_zero`, `C.c_last` and `C.mono` give it, or use
