### 130.6 ADDENDUM — THE FIT LEMMA DECOMPOSED (engines requested from the fleet)

The fit lemma of §130.2 is the following statement (in the chart-flow model `Hfun D`, which is the
chart-coordinate description of the exponential map, `UnitformInj.Hfun`):

